m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

19:12.550 --> 19:15.550
Muramatsuya

19:12.550 --> 19:15.550
Candy Apples

19:12.550 --> 19:15.550
*Note sale date!*

19:25.250 --> 19:26.610
Welcome.

19:27.330 --> 19:28.940
Table for one?

19:28.940 --> 19:31.370
Um... I'm meeting someone inside.

19:42.790 --> 19:43.810
Kept you waiting.

19:44.420 --> 19:45.380
Nah.

19:52.170 --> 19:53.670
yen

19:52.170 --> 19:53.670
Cherry

19:52.170 --> 19:53.670
Banana

19:52.170 --> 19:53.670
Pineapple

19:52.170 --> 19:53.670
Kiwi

19:52.170 --> 19:53.670
Crepe

19:52.170 --> 19:53.670
Mango

19:52.170 --> 19:53.670
Whipped Cream

19:52.170 --> 19:53.670
Watermelon

19:52.170 --> 19:53.670
Melon

19:56.090 --> 19:59.330
It's on me today.

20:00.060 --> 20:01.930
For helping me out.

20:05.560 --> 20:08.720
Two summer tropical parfaits, please.

20:19.310 --> 20:21.280
Hey, Kobato-kun.

20:21.700 --> 20:23.970
It's no fun if you don't say anything.

20:23.970 --> 20:26.440
Talk about something.

20:33.700 --> 20:35.040
Okay, then.

20:35.040 --> 20:41.090
A word on how fulfilling the summer break
of our second year of high school has been.

20:43.370 --> 20:44.720
This summer,

20:44.720 --> 20:48.170
we got caught up in an extraordinary 
incident unbefitting of ordinary people.

20:49.670 --> 20:53.800
What started off as a summer 
spent enjoying sweets together

20:53.800 --> 20:56.340
became a summer 
I don't think we'll ever forget.

20:57.850 --> 20:58.780
But...

21:02.430 --> 21:06.710
You knew you were going to be 
kidnapped, didn't you, Osanai-san?
